      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is a problem because:\n1. This will cause `d.Javadoc.exportableStubsSrcJar` to be `nil`.\n2. `StubsSrcJar(StubsType)` uses `d.Javadoc.exportableStubsSrcJar` without checking for `nil` and so could return `nil`.\n3. `OutputFiles(String)` uses `StubsSrcJar(StubsType)` and returns a `Paths{nil}` which seems like a bad idea.\n\nSo, either remove this conditional, or if that causes problems (because something in make expects `LOCAL_DROIDDOC_STUBS_SRCJAR` to not be set if the file is never produced then I think `StubsSrcJar(StubsType)` needs a check to see if the file it returns exists and if it does not error.",
